## Purpose
Anchor agents with succinct project context and goals.

## Applies When
- Reading project docs or top-level overview files.

## Project Description
- DIPPI: A research-grade ML/DL pipeline for reproducible training and evaluation.
- Deliverables: clean `src/` package, YAML-driven experiments, tracked checkpoints, rigorous evaluation.

## Goals
- Reproducibility, observability, and maintainable code.
- Consistent outputs for training/eval; deterministic seeds; portable configs.

## Non-Goals
- Unnecessary complexity; avoid novel/undocumented stacks unless justified.
